[{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_02_0005","text":"节目主持人"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_02_0010","text":"对对，成员就是\n浅仓同学和她的朋友们对吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_02_0020","text":"诶？　与其说是我……大家都是青梅竹马\n从这边开始依次是，樋口────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_02_0030","text":"很少见呢！　各地的地方偶像都在活跃\n但青梅竹马组合很新鲜！　啊，真的是青梅竹马吗～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_02_0097","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_02_0040","text":"抱歉抱歉！那就让我们看看朋友之间的羁绊吧\n广告之后，noctchill带来《无论何时我们都是》"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_02_0099","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_02_0050","text":"……\n流程也好，提问也好，全都不一样"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_02_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_02_0060","text":"走吧──\n他们不是想看友情的羁绊嘛"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_02_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_02_0070","text":"那还不简单──\n就是说跟平时一样就行了呗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_02_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_02_0080","text":"啊～！\n那确实简单～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_02_0090","text":"小糸，放开了去做\n会好好拍到你镜头的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_02_0100","text":"…………\n透、透同学……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_02_0110","text":"拜托了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_02_0111","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_02_0006","text":"AD"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_02_0120","text":"倒数５秒、４、３、２────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_02_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_02_0007","text":"节目导演"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_02_0130","text":"喂、喂……！\n切换镜头！　拍其他孩子！！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_02_0140","text":"透……！？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_02_0150","text":"萤～萤～\n萤火虫飞过来……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_02_0160","text":"呀哈～～～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_02_0170","text":"等等！？\n那孩子也不行！　镜头！　拍其他孩子，其他孩子！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_02_0180","text":"（咇、咇诶……！？）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_02_0181","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_02_0190","text":"……呵————"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_02_0200","text":"（噔噔，噔噔噔\n　噔─噔─噔噔……！）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_02_0092","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_02_0091","text":"Motion"}]
